WEBVTT

01:40.270 --> 01:42.960
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.190 --> 01:45.920
[Episode 15]

01:46.400 --> 01:48.710
If the two halves of the Baize Token are merged outside our bodies,

01:48.710 --> 01:50.470
can it be returned

01:50.630 --> 01:52.500
to Baize Goddess?

01:53.030 --> 01:54.229
Brat,

01:54.229 --> 01:56.150
you finally said that.

01:56.280 --> 01:57.880
So you know your place.

01:58.070 --> 02:00.430
I thought you were going to keep it for yourself.

01:58.130 --> 02:00.790
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

02:00.550 --> 02:01.990
I don't want it.

02:00.820 --> 02:03.330
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

02:02.510 --> 02:03.670
The responsibility is too heavy.

02:03.540 --> 02:08.590
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

02:04.630 --> 02:07.030
I just want to be a free great demon.

02:08.020 --> 02:09.270
Go wherever I want

02:09.669 --> 02:11.020
and do whatever I want

02:09.910 --> 02:11.760
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

02:11.430 --> 02:12.690
without a care in the world.

02:11.910 --> 02:14.630
♫Someone is longing for♫

02:14.720 --> 02:16.200
♫Softly calling for♫

02:16.240 --> 02:19.390
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

02:17.550 --> 02:19.190
Activating the Constellation Formation

02:19.190 --> 02:21.760
requires two Mountain Gods.

02:22.120 --> 02:22.750
By then,

02:22.750 --> 02:23.590
Zhu Yin and I

02:23.670 --> 02:24.950
will assist them

02:25.230 --> 02:26.030
from the side.

02:27.070 --> 02:28.070
You two

02:28.110 --> 02:29.390
just need to

02:29.750 --> 02:32.310
activate the Baize Token in the formation.

02:33.990 --> 02:34.820
Great.

02:35.310 --> 02:36.910
The Wilderness can be saved.

02:49.410 --> 02:50.400
Sister Pei.

02:57.530 --> 02:59.990
Zhuo is still up there trying to cheer Jiu up.

03:00.530 --> 03:01.930
Jiu is too young.

03:02.790 --> 03:05.450
He doesn't understand that it wasn't personal.

03:05.710 --> 03:07.750
It's just that the situation was perilous

03:07.750 --> 03:09.080
and we had to be careful.

03:09.270 --> 03:10.390
You're right.

03:12.870 --> 03:14.350
But the plan of the Demon Hunting Bureau

03:14.350 --> 03:16.480
was indeed leaked to the Chongwu Camp.

03:17.100 --> 03:18.800
So I don't think

03:19.150 --> 03:21.050
Mr. Situ is mistaken

03:21.110 --> 03:22.340
about the mole.

03:25.920 --> 03:27.260
By the way, Sister Pei,

03:27.750 --> 03:28.880
where are you going?

03:32.560 --> 03:35.420
The Chongwu Camp is great at tracking,

03:35.860 --> 03:37.520
especially tracking demons.

03:37.790 --> 03:39.320
They've never failed at it.

03:39.600 --> 03:40.610
Maybe

03:41.020 --> 03:42.970
they tracked Zhao Yuanzhou here.

03:44.120 --> 03:45.600
For safety's sake,

03:45.780 --> 03:47.450
I'll go check the perimeter.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.560
I'm just a kid.

04:12.830 --> 04:14.120
It's easy to cheer me up.

04:14.120 --> 04:15.400
Just some candy

04:15.400 --> 04:16.860
or a pat on the head will do.

04:21.589 --> 04:23.050
Did you just throw it at me?

04:36.640 --> 04:39.220
Don't you like fruit?

05:19.350 --> 05:20.150
Grandpa.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.290
All these years,

05:22.320 --> 05:23.750
you've been protecting Mount Kunlun,

05:23.750 --> 05:25.530
which is on the brink of destruction.

05:25.530 --> 05:26.810
Don't you feel tired?

05:27.950 --> 05:29.070
I do,

05:30.790 --> 05:32.150
but it's my duty.

05:36.990 --> 05:37.790
Boy,

05:38.830 --> 05:41.070
do you know what it takes

05:41.070 --> 05:42.600
to become the Mountain God?

05:44.480 --> 05:46.140
One needs to have divine blood

05:46.730 --> 05:48.530
and be very powerful.

05:51.700 --> 05:53.140
Wrong.

05:53.760 --> 05:56.350
What makes you the Mountain God

05:57.230 --> 05:58.510
is your determination

05:58.510 --> 06:01.720
to protect the Wilderness.

06:10.060 --> 06:10.990
Boy.

06:13.210 --> 06:15.040
Whether to stay in the Wilderness

06:15.040 --> 06:16.610
or go to the mortal world

06:17.200 --> 06:18.380
is your decision

06:18.410 --> 06:19.880
to make.

06:20.480 --> 06:22.730
No matter what your choice is,

06:23.460 --> 06:25.120
I'll support you.

06:26.310 --> 06:27.150
In this world,

06:27.630 --> 06:29.410
there are thousands of paths

06:29.590 --> 06:31.440
leading to your destination.

06:32.440 --> 06:34.990
As for which one is right for you,

06:36.430 --> 06:38.090
you have to find out yourself.

07:01.500 --> 07:02.150
Sure enough.

07:02.150 --> 07:02.830
You wouldn't waste

07:02.830 --> 07:04.590
the fruit Mr. Zhuo gave you.

07:05.150 --> 07:06.410
None of your business.

07:07.950 --> 07:10.530
Looks like Zhuo messed up his apology.

07:10.990 --> 07:12.640
He's really stupid.

07:16.110 --> 07:17.320
I called him stupid.

07:17.430 --> 07:18.690
Why are you angry?

07:18.720 --> 07:20.380
If they had suspected you,

07:20.720 --> 07:21.960
would you be angry?

07:22.670 --> 07:24.670
As long as I have a clear conscience,

07:24.910 --> 07:26.510
I don't care

07:26.630 --> 07:27.960
what others think of me.

07:32.950 --> 07:34.409
But rumors are scary.

07:34.830 --> 07:36.220
Born in the Wilderness,

07:37.030 --> 07:39.490
you naturally don't know what rumors can do.

07:40.200 --> 07:41.970
So it's better to be a demon.

07:42.040 --> 07:44.240
I don't need to guess what others think.

07:45.870 --> 07:46.790
Where are you going?

07:46.790 --> 07:48.320
I'm going to do something bad.

07:48.320 --> 07:50.120
To find some demons and have fun.

07:51.380 --> 07:52.990
When did Little Bunny learn

07:52.990 --> 07:54.390
to speak sarcastically?

07:54.710 --> 07:56.110
You've rubbed off on him.

08:04.310 --> 08:05.670
It's just the two of us now.

08:05.670 --> 08:06.300
Tell me.

08:14.190 --> 08:14.990
Tell you what?

08:16.350 --> 08:17.700
What day is tomorrow?

08:17.910 --> 08:19.270
What will happen?

08:20.450 --> 08:22.160
You looked worried just now.

08:22.270 --> 08:24.730
There's definitely something on your mind.

08:25.790 --> 08:27.430
Lady Goddess, I didn't expect you

08:27.430 --> 08:29.030
to pay so much attention to me.

08:29.030 --> 08:30.110
I'm so touched.

08:31.910 --> 08:33.140
I have no choice.

08:33.549 --> 08:35.270
To make the Baize Token complete,

08:35.270 --> 08:36.950
we must be of one mind.

08:42.630 --> 08:44.070
You once asked me

08:45.150 --> 08:47.480
why I was controlled by malicious energy.

08:51.030 --> 08:52.670
You didn't answer me then.

08:57.030 --> 08:58.670
The night I lost control,

09:00.390 --> 09:01.780
it was a blood moon.

09:05.790 --> 09:06.590
Blood moon?

09:08.030 --> 09:09.390
On a blood moon,

09:10.380 --> 09:12.440
malicious energy is the most strong.

09:14.120 --> 09:16.120
With so much malicious energy in me,

09:17.520 --> 09:18.830
if I can't control it,

09:19.890 --> 09:21.440
I'll be consumed by it.

09:27.150 --> 09:28.370
You mean…

09:31.070 --> 09:32.150
Tomorrow night…

09:38.310 --> 09:39.430
Are you worried

09:40.150 --> 09:41.810
you may lose control again?

09:43.790 --> 09:45.350
On that blood moon,

09:47.460 --> 09:49.520
malicious energy took control of me,

09:50.340 --> 09:51.940
and I lost consciousness.

09:53.610 --> 09:55.140
In a trance,

09:58.440 --> 10:01.300
I killed many people from the Demon Hunting Bureau.

10:07.800 --> 10:09.130
Logically speaking,

10:09.440 --> 10:11.770
the blood moon would last the whole night.

10:12.380 --> 10:13.550
But somehow,

10:14.580 --> 10:15.630
that night,

10:16.470 --> 10:18.560
I regained my sanity very soon.

10:19.430 --> 10:20.360
When I woke up,

10:21.110 --> 10:22.860
I was already inside the White Emperor Tower.

10:22.860 --> 10:26.090
[The Wilderness]

10:30.180 --> 10:31.980
I never understood the reason.

10:34.750 --> 10:36.150
Now that I think about it,

10:36.630 --> 10:38.220
your master, Zhao Wan'er,

10:38.880 --> 10:40.360
must have sent half of the Baize Token

10:40.360 --> 10:41.910
into my body

10:42.740 --> 10:45.600
to suppress the uncontrollable malicious energy.

10:46.870 --> 10:48.150
Otherwise,

10:50.060 --> 10:52.720
the consequences would've been unimaginable.

10:53.610 --> 10:55.410
You went through so much trouble

10:55.550 --> 10:57.810
to help me find the Baize Token

10:58.590 --> 10:59.630
just to...

10:59.830 --> 11:00.850
To end my life.

11:06.880 --> 11:08.390
My wish can be fulfilled,

11:09.640 --> 11:12.100
and you can get the world rid of a great demon.

11:18.750 --> 11:21.010
Do you know why your master, Zhao Wan'er,

11:21.700 --> 11:23.780
gave her brother's name

11:24.270 --> 11:25.230
to me?

11:27.630 --> 11:28.590
No.

11:33.020 --> 11:34.860
I asked her that question.

11:35.940 --> 11:37.470
She told me

11:41.110 --> 11:42.930
because I was like a prisoner

11:44.030 --> 11:45.290
in a sea of bitterness.

11:47.190 --> 11:47.990
Death

11:50.100 --> 11:52.680
is my only escape.

11:58.430 --> 12:00.290
If I lose control again tomorrow,

12:03.670 --> 12:05.900
you must kill me with the Baize Token.

12:45.830 --> 12:46.750
Boys,

12:47.510 --> 12:48.710
wait a little longer.

12:50.100 --> 12:52.790
It's about time to hunt.

12:57.550 --> 12:58.910
If…

13:00.030 --> 13:01.960
the Baize Token stays in your body,

13:03.790 --> 13:06.310
you won't be consumed by malicious energy

13:08.110 --> 13:09.640
and lose control, will you?

13:10.950 --> 13:11.750
No.

13:13.860 --> 13:16.460
But to activate the Constellation Formation,

13:17.870 --> 13:20.470
the Baize Token must be merged outside my body.

13:22.430 --> 13:24.630
The formation will be finished by noon.

13:26.300 --> 13:27.310
After that,

13:27.430 --> 13:29.630
can't we divide the Baize Token into two

13:29.670 --> 13:32.150
and send a half back into your body?

13:39.390 --> 13:41.720
It's better than letting you lose control

13:41.830 --> 13:43.290
and start a killing spree.

13:48.430 --> 13:49.480
You can actually…

13:51.930 --> 13:53.410
sympathize with a demon?

13:54.370 --> 13:56.110
Demons are born aggressive.

13:56.440 --> 13:58.640
That's why they need to be disciplined.

13:59.740 --> 14:01.800
Demons wish to be accepted by humans.

14:02.590 --> 14:04.250
We also wish

14:04.350 --> 14:05.750
demons wouldn't hurt us.

14:06.630 --> 14:09.190
But there are always demons disguised as humans

14:09.190 --> 14:11.050
causing chaos in the mortal world

14:11.830 --> 14:13.150
and spreading fear.

14:22.840 --> 14:25.640
You always say you can't hate the Wilderness more,

14:26.160 --> 14:27.260
but actually,

14:28.270 --> 14:30.130
you love it more than anyone else,

14:31.550 --> 14:32.510
don't you?

14:38.730 --> 14:39.410
I…

14:46.160 --> 14:47.170
What's wrong?

14:50.320 --> 14:51.980
It's happened a lot recently.

14:52.630 --> 14:53.960
It's not the first time.

14:55.270 --> 14:56.530
What's wrong with you?

14:57.180 --> 14:59.910
It's all because of the contract you made me sign.

15:01.590 --> 15:03.120
Which term did you violate?

15:05.870 --> 15:07.220
The one that says

15:07.550 --> 15:09.280
I shall stay with you willingly

15:10.230 --> 15:11.630
as your colleague.

15:19.050 --> 15:20.860
You broke the contract.

15:21.660 --> 15:22.990
You deserve the pain.

15:25.830 --> 15:27.270
You're so cruel.

15:32.950 --> 15:33.830
No.

15:33.830 --> 15:34.670
I'm pretty and kind,

15:34.670 --> 15:35.190
okay?

15:36.190 --> 15:37.590
Since you're so pitiful,

15:37.590 --> 15:39.330
I'll teach you a spell

15:39.370 --> 15:41.050
to relieve your pain.

15:42.560 --> 15:43.920
There's such a spell?

15:44.350 --> 15:44.870
Yes.

15:45.210 --> 15:46.940
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

15:49.300 --> 15:50.760
Form is indeed emptiness,

15:51.320 --> 15:52.650
emptiness indeed form.

15:57.110 --> 15:58.570
It's from the Heart Sutra.

15:58.630 --> 16:00.010
Read it now and then.

16:00.670 --> 16:01.270
Clear the bad ideas

16:01.270 --> 16:02.550
from your mind.

16:08.310 --> 16:09.470
Look at Zhuo

16:09.470 --> 16:10.310
and then you.

16:10.990 --> 16:12.390
You're not in his league.

16:13.860 --> 16:15.690
Zhuo is like your brother.

16:15.760 --> 16:17.290
Of course we're different.

16:18.230 --> 16:20.990
You assume that Zhuo is like a brother to me.

16:20.990 --> 16:22.450
I don't think he'll agree.

16:23.720 --> 16:24.920
What else could he be?

16:25.790 --> 16:26.790
Who knows?

16:27.040 --> 16:29.190
After all, Zhuo is so handsome

16:29.390 --> 16:32.390
that he's the dreamboat of countless girls in Tiandu.

16:32.670 --> 16:34.620
And he and I grew up together.

16:36.840 --> 16:37.640
Listen.

16:43.550 --> 16:44.510
What?

16:47.440 --> 16:49.150
The sound of jealousy.

17:12.589 --> 17:14.190
I know I can't persuade you,

17:15.150 --> 17:16.430
but I believe

17:16.880 --> 17:17.960
that one day

17:17.990 --> 17:20.720
you'll meet the person who makes you want to live.

17:51.210 --> 17:55.130
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

17:55.600 --> 17:58.450
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

17:59.690 --> 18:03.620
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

18:03.860 --> 18:06.830
♫The way back home♫

18:07.600 --> 18:09.200
♫With strong will♫

18:09.490 --> 18:13.140
♫I slowly carve out♫

18:13.590 --> 18:15.410
♫Growth♫

18:15.990 --> 18:17.550
♫Turning back♫

18:18.050 --> 18:21.460
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

18:22.160 --> 18:23.850
♫Waiting there♫

18:39.630 --> 18:41.560
Ms. Pei, you're really something.

18:42.370 --> 18:44.230
You actually found me here.

18:49.360 --> 18:50.660
Jiu.

18:55.580 --> 18:57.620
Mr. Zhuo, you're so diligent.

18:58.270 --> 18:59.860
It's so late. Instead of sleeping,

18:59.860 --> 19:01.910
you're secretly practicing swordsmanship.

19:01.910 --> 19:03.110
The sooner I learn it,

19:04.190 --> 19:05.520
the sooner I can kill you

19:06.400 --> 19:08.070
to fulfill your wish.

19:08.680 --> 19:10.200
It's a win-win.

19:10.830 --> 19:12.690
Of course I need to practice hard.

19:13.610 --> 19:15.140
Practice makes perfect,

19:15.550 --> 19:17.090
but if you do it wrongly

19:17.290 --> 19:18.750
and get ahead of yourself,

19:18.840 --> 19:20.600
you'll hurt yourself.

19:23.610 --> 19:24.870
None of your business.

19:25.430 --> 19:26.550
I taught you this.

19:27.180 --> 19:28.710
Of course it's my business.

20:41.740 --> 20:42.580
Who is he?

20:43.000 --> 20:44.330
Your ancestor,

20:44.710 --> 20:45.430
Bingyi,

20:46.010 --> 20:48.340
the first master of the Cloud Light Sword.

20:52.080 --> 20:53.560
The sword technique just now...

20:53.560 --> 20:55.670
Was the very one Bingyi used

20:55.700 --> 20:56.980
to slay Ying Long.

20:58.680 --> 20:59.800
Can it kill you?

21:01.270 --> 21:03.330
Ying Long was much stronger than I am.

21:03.530 --> 21:05.130
It was an ancient great demon

21:05.340 --> 21:06.800
that could kill Ying Long,

21:06.800 --> 21:08.560
so of course, it could kill me too.

21:08.560 --> 21:10.360
Take your time to understand it.

21:12.820 --> 21:14.150
Why are you teaching me?

21:15.050 --> 21:16.510
Didn't I already tell you?

21:16.750 --> 21:18.030
I want you to kill me.

21:19.190 --> 21:20.350
You're lying.

21:21.720 --> 21:22.560
I'm not.

21:22.590 --> 21:23.950
When you made the oath with me

21:23.950 --> 21:25.430
in the dungeon back then,

21:25.530 --> 21:26.930
you truly weren't lying.

21:29.790 --> 21:32.660
I'll teach you the true way to use the Cloud Light Sword.

21:32.660 --> 21:33.670
Then...

21:33.770 --> 21:35.320
Kill me.

21:36.500 --> 21:37.940
Back then, you were consumed

21:37.940 --> 21:39.070
by a desire for death,

21:39.070 --> 21:40.870
and your eyes were void of light.

21:41.670 --> 21:42.760
But now,

21:43.450 --> 21:44.570
I can see that

21:44.780 --> 21:46.180
you no longer wish to die.

21:51.600 --> 21:53.090
Is it because of Wen Xiao?

21:57.970 --> 21:59.830
I've always found the Wilderness

21:59.830 --> 22:01.340
to be cold and lifeless.

22:01.680 --> 22:04.010
Living for a thousand years has been dull.

22:04.630 --> 22:07.320
But after wandering the mortal world a few times,

22:07.320 --> 22:09.300
I found that mortal hearts

22:09.510 --> 22:10.710
have their own charm.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.840
So, for now, I don't want to die.

22:13.470 --> 22:14.330
Zhao Yuanzhou,

22:14.870 --> 22:15.970
trust me.

22:16.300 --> 22:17.380
The further you go,

22:17.540 --> 22:19.070
the less you'll want to die.

22:19.680 --> 22:21.740
No matter how well you treat Wen Xiao,

22:21.870 --> 22:23.670
I've already sworn a deadly oath

22:24.350 --> 22:25.510
that one day,

22:26.590 --> 22:28.510
I will kill you with my sword.

22:30.350 --> 22:33.210
If I truly grasp the essence of the Cloud Light Sword

22:33.950 --> 22:36.280
and master the technique in the illusion,

22:37.560 --> 22:38.760
won't you regret it?

22:44.310 --> 22:45.270
No, I won't.

22:48.710 --> 22:49.840
I don't understand.

22:50.230 --> 22:51.200
Why?

22:52.300 --> 22:54.030
Since you no longer want to die,

22:54.620 --> 22:56.280
why are you still teaching me?

22:56.520 --> 23:00.370
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

22:57.290 --> 22:59.120
Living with contradictions—

22:59.950 --> 23:00.980
doesn't it make you uncomfortable?

23:00.980 --> 23:03.750
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

23:03.820 --> 23:05.440
Many people in this world

23:04.940 --> 23:08.940
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

23:05.510 --> 23:07.220
live with contradictions.

23:07.360 --> 23:08.910
I'm not the only one

23:09.160 --> 23:12.020
♫The way back home♫

23:11.010 --> 23:13.180
heading south without hesitation,

23:12.780 --> 23:14.480
♫With strong will♫

23:13.650 --> 23:15.880
yet there's always a voice in my mind

23:14.780 --> 23:18.390
♫I slowly carve out♫

23:15.950 --> 23:17.590
calling me to look north.

23:18.970 --> 23:20.640
♫Growth♫

23:21.290 --> 23:22.880
♫Turning back♫

23:23.190 --> 23:24.330
Mr. Zhuo,

23:23.380 --> 23:26.750
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

23:26.210 --> 23:27.470
tomorrow's magic formation

23:27.470 --> 23:29.270
will determine the survival of the Wilderness.

23:27.500 --> 23:29.270
♫Waiting there♫

23:30.490 --> 23:32.350
If anything unexpected happens,

23:34.630 --> 23:35.820
I hope you can...

23:35.840 --> 23:36.900
If there's danger,

23:37.110 --> 23:38.980
I'll ensure Wen Xiao's safety.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.730
I meant me.

23:44.910 --> 23:45.710
You?

23:46.820 --> 23:48.600
A thousand-year-old great demon

23:48.600 --> 23:50.470
needs my protection?

23:51.260 --> 23:52.320
How embarrassing.

23:54.160 --> 23:55.360
How is that possible?

23:59.830 --> 24:02.130
What I meant is that I hope you live well.

24:03.340 --> 24:05.160
♫Sunset♫

24:05.500 --> 24:07.570
♫Old tiles♫

24:07.230 --> 24:08.190
I don't need you to tell me that.

24:07.620 --> 24:11.490
♫Manjusaka♫

24:09.510 --> 24:10.820
You owe me a life.

24:11.830 --> 24:12.750
As long as you're alive,

24:11.870 --> 24:13.800
♫A single wing♫

24:13.830 --> 24:15.520
♫Struggles to♫

24:14.130 --> 24:15.400
I won't die before you.

24:15.900 --> 24:20.750
♫Maintain a dual balance♫

24:16.630 --> 24:17.430
Fine.

24:19.630 --> 24:21.510
Then please keep your word

24:22.150 --> 24:23.310
and let me die first.

24:44.280 --> 24:45.380
Where's Jiu?

24:45.950 --> 24:48.160
He should be with Ms. Pei.

24:49.290 --> 24:50.190
That's good.

24:52.620 --> 24:53.420
Ying Lei,

24:54.020 --> 24:55.900
come with me to stand guard outside,

24:55.900 --> 24:58.880
so Wen Xiao and the others can focus on their spellcasting.

24:58.880 --> 24:59.840
No problem.

25:07.870 --> 25:09.480
It's noon now.

25:10.060 --> 25:12.230
Once the formation begins,

25:12.250 --> 25:13.710
it cannot be interrupted.

25:14.030 --> 25:15.060
Are you

25:15.310 --> 25:16.990
all prepared?

25:22.840 --> 25:23.860
Yes.

26:15.710 --> 26:17.910
Finally.

26:29.270 --> 26:30.260
Zhu Yin,

26:31.260 --> 26:32.460
start the formation!

26:33.870 --> 26:35.730
The stars align

26:35.990 --> 26:37.820
to stabilize the universe.

26:38.110 --> 26:38.830
Protect!

26:52.410 --> 26:54.020
All sources converge.

26:55.100 --> 26:57.200
Yin and Yang reflect each other,

26:57.390 --> 26:59.450
and heaven and earth work in harmony.

27:00.150 --> 27:00.950
Unite.

27:01.750 --> 27:02.670
Unite.

28:36.030 --> 28:37.030
What's going on?

28:45.560 --> 28:46.300
Zhu Yin,

28:46.330 --> 28:46.930
you...

28:48.100 --> 28:49.020
Zhu Yin,

28:50.030 --> 28:52.360
I knew there was something wrong with you.

28:58.370 --> 29:01.830
The Star Formation requires two Mountain Gods to complete it.

29:02.150 --> 29:03.080
Ying Zhao,

29:03.490 --> 29:05.320
it's useless for you to hold on alone.

29:05.320 --> 29:07.580
Stop dreaming of saving the Wilderness.

29:46.390 --> 29:47.520
It's you?

29:47.750 --> 29:48.830
Mr. Zhuo,

29:49.070 --> 29:50.320
we meet again.

30:05.460 --> 30:06.790
No, something's wrong.

30:07.210 --> 30:08.340
They are not humans,

30:10.860 --> 30:12.060
nor demons.

30:13.000 --> 30:14.040
They are...

30:15.750 --> 30:16.550
They are...

30:21.950 --> 30:22.670
Ying Lei.

30:23.750 --> 30:24.880
Fall back behind me.

31:21.220 --> 31:22.340
Fish scales?

31:23.150 --> 31:24.490
That's Henggong fish from the Wilderness!

31:24.490 --> 31:25.860
Henggong fish?

31:33.000 --> 31:35.260
The scales of Ran Yi are incredibly rare.

31:35.630 --> 31:36.790
Here, take these.

31:37.270 --> 31:38.350
Maybe later,

31:38.700 --> 31:40.900
when you develop a new divine medicine,

31:41.670 --> 31:42.730
they'll be useful.

31:50.210 --> 31:51.390
These scales

31:51.990 --> 31:53.270
are so hard and sharp.

31:55.920 --> 31:58.250
They could even be used as hidden weapons.

31:58.360 --> 31:59.980
There's something more powerful.

31:59.980 --> 32:00.670
Good stuff.

32:00.700 --> 32:02.970
I once saw a monster in the Wilderness

32:03.030 --> 32:04.670
called Henggong fish.

32:04.950 --> 32:06.830
Its scales are as hard as steel,

32:06.890 --> 32:08.350
impervious to blades and spears.

32:08.350 --> 32:09.270
Sounds like

32:09.430 --> 32:11.160
it would make excellent armor.

32:44.000 --> 32:45.230
Its whole body is red,

32:45.340 --> 32:47.330
and its roar can shatter mountains and stone.

32:47.330 --> 32:48.400
Could it be...

32:48.620 --> 32:49.390
Zheng?

32:52.610 --> 32:54.030
What you're describing

32:54.320 --> 32:56.450
are all monsters from the Wilderness.

32:56.750 --> 32:58.160
But they are human.

32:58.180 --> 32:58.950
Are you insane?

32:58.950 --> 33:00.350
How could these be human?

33:08.790 --> 33:09.770
Zhu Yin,

33:10.400 --> 33:12.030
why are you doing this?

33:13.800 --> 33:15.170
Because he and I

33:15.190 --> 33:16.850
share the same goal.

33:22.420 --> 33:23.490
Ying Zhao,

33:23.820 --> 33:25.440
long time no see.

33:50.350 --> 33:52.620
These despicable tricks again.

33:53.690 --> 33:56.310
The number of times you can possess others is limited.

33:56.310 --> 33:57.330
Li Lun,

33:57.630 --> 34:00.710
you use forbidden arts so recklessly.

34:00.990 --> 34:02.670
Are you, like me,

34:02.870 --> 34:04.450
set on death?

34:18.469 --> 34:19.270
Zhu Yin,

34:20.310 --> 34:22.040
you, a dignified Mountain God,

34:22.760 --> 34:26.420
have fallen so low as to conspire with Li Lun, like a pack of wolves.

34:27.389 --> 34:29.260
A pack of wolves?

34:31.510 --> 34:33.469
Now, you even use us demons

34:33.780 --> 34:35.659
as comparisons in insults.

34:36.070 --> 34:37.150
Good for you,

34:37.150 --> 34:38.010
Zhao Yuanzhou.

34:39.590 --> 34:41.719
You've been living in the mortal world

34:41.760 --> 34:43.179
under someone else's name for so long

34:43.179 --> 34:44.230
that you've forgotten

34:44.230 --> 34:45.830
you're a notorious great demon,

34:45.830 --> 34:47.030
Zhu Yan, haven't you?

34:48.239 --> 34:49.989
Your goal is to

34:50.469 --> 34:52.719
bring ruin to the Wilderness

34:52.980 --> 34:55.510
and lead all demons to their deaths, isn't it?

34:56.449 --> 34:57.820
You're wrong.

34:58.270 --> 35:00.740
It's to allow all living beings in the Wilderness

35:00.740 --> 35:03.030
to freely travel between the two worlds,

35:03.520 --> 35:05.210
no longer confined to this

35:05.580 --> 35:06.590
desolate,

35:07.180 --> 35:08.920
barren land.

35:28.420 --> 35:31.570
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

35:31.630 --> 35:34.910
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

35:36.960 --> 35:39.870
♫Who truly decides fate's design?♫

35:39.930 --> 35:43.290
♫Vividly painted in black and white♫

35:45.100 --> 35:48.330
♫It's water under the bridge♫

35:48.370 --> 35:51.480
♫The moon sheds her light on my heart♫

35:53.610 --> 35:56.630
♫The good old days are gone for good like that lantern in my dream♫

35:55.340 --> 35:56.360
Master once said,

35:56.510 --> 35:58.360
"It's impolite not to reciprocate."

35:56.660 --> 36:00.180
♫See immortals enter Penglai♫

35:58.640 --> 36:00.480
Since I ate your apple,

36:00.040 --> 36:04.420
[Book of Rites]

36:00.750 --> 36:01.910
I'll gift you

36:01.270 --> 36:04.730
♫The northern wind blows from beyond the mountains♫

36:02.050 --> 36:03.650
this Book of Rites in return.

36:05.670 --> 36:08.710
♫Along the icy river, it drifts into my dreams♫

36:09.830 --> 36:12.920
♫Drinking wine at the Tongque Terrace♫

36:13.870 --> 36:16.360
♫Even the stars feel close enough to touch♫

36:15.430 --> 36:17.300
I am the keeper of this temple.

36:16.390 --> 36:20.500
♫Life and death happen in an instant, but love and hate can endure for a long time♫

36:17.860 --> 36:19.410
Do you even know

36:19.440 --> 36:20.780
which god you're worshipping?

36:20.780 --> 36:23.910
♫Beyond cause and effect♫

36:21.030 --> 36:22.340
This is Mountain God,

36:22.600 --> 36:23.600
Zhu Yin.

36:24.880 --> 36:28.690
♫The heavens endure, the world remains eternal♫

36:25.510 --> 36:26.540
Oh.

36:26.950 --> 36:27.810
I know.

36:27.920 --> 36:29.480
Zhu Yin is actually the Torch Dragon, right?

36:29.130 --> 36:32.950
♫Rock and moss♫

36:29.670 --> 36:30.940
People say

36:31.070 --> 36:32.340
the Torch Dragon has great powers.

36:32.340 --> 36:33.350
It controls celestial phenomena

36:33.350 --> 36:34.620
and can move mountains and rivers with its breath.

36:33.720 --> 36:34.840
♫Are watching♫

36:34.900 --> 36:37.920
♫A lone boat drifts through the vast world, vanishing into mist♫

36:35.020 --> 36:36.210
Little scholar,

36:37.080 --> 36:38.330
while he may be powerful,

36:37.970 --> 36:40.960
♫Its sound fading away♫

36:38.360 --> 36:39.290
he can't control

36:39.300 --> 36:40.870
whether or not

36:40.920 --> 36:43.310
you achieve top honors in the imperial examination.

36:42.200 --> 36:43.050
♫I wish♫

36:43.130 --> 36:46.250
♫The sorrow of parting stayed beyond the river, and that we did not share the same mountain and moon♫

36:43.390 --> 36:45.150
I didn't ask Lord Torch Dragon

36:45.150 --> 36:46.650
to make me a Number One Scholar.

36:46.300 --> 36:50.120
♫Deep love, yet fate runs shallow♫

36:46.870 --> 36:48.070
Reading the classics

36:48.070 --> 36:50.170
is to broaden my horizons

36:50.200 --> 36:52.070
and avoid being narrow-minded or self-restrained.

36:52.070 --> 36:53.750
You're here as the temple keeper,

36:53.750 --> 36:54.880
trapped in one place

36:54.910 --> 36:56.110
day after day.

36:56.190 --> 36:57.850
You may not quite understand.

36:57.910 --> 36:58.750
You should

36:58.780 --> 37:00.430
go down the mountain more often.

37:00.430 --> 37:01.630
If you don't understand,

37:01.630 --> 37:03.040
you're welcome to visit me anytime.

37:03.040 --> 37:04.870
I live right at the foot of the mountain,

37:04.870 --> 37:07.470
in the house under the big tree on the west side.

37:19.470 --> 37:21.670
What did Li Lun offer you?

37:22.590 --> 37:24.190
There's no need for an offer.

37:25.760 --> 37:27.760
He and I share the same goal.

37:29.140 --> 37:30.800
Demons are demons.

37:32.150 --> 37:34.960
We will never be accepted by mortals.

37:36.600 --> 37:38.530
What did you add in the tea?

37:38.990 --> 37:40.710
Why did you harm me?

37:52.910 --> 37:54.120
Didn't you say

37:54.230 --> 37:55.290
that studying

37:55.350 --> 37:57.940
is to understand human affairs,

37:58.040 --> 37:59.320
broaden horizons,

37:59.400 --> 38:01.660
and recognize the vastness of the world,

38:01.680 --> 38:03.940
avoiding narrow-mindedness and self-restriction?

38:03.940 --> 38:05.550
But you're a demon.

38:14.590 --> 38:16.900
Why do you want recognition from them?

38:19.490 --> 38:21.210
Baize Goddess

38:21.730 --> 38:23.390
is just a mortal.

38:24.200 --> 38:27.110
On what basis can she set the rules for demons?

38:29.170 --> 38:30.330
Li Lun,

38:31.000 --> 38:33.310
many demons yearn for the mortal world,

38:34.070 --> 38:36.060
but there are also many

38:36.200 --> 38:39.030
who prefer the eternal tranquility of the Wilderness,

38:39.030 --> 38:40.890
living in harmony with the world.

38:41.630 --> 38:43.970
So on what basis can you decide for them

38:44.960 --> 38:46.870
and destroy their homeland?

38:46.950 --> 38:49.560
That's because they are timid and cowardly,

38:50.080 --> 38:52.140
afraid to step into the mortal world.

38:53.840 --> 38:54.900
Zhu Yan,

38:56.570 --> 38:57.750
don't forget.

38:59.320 --> 39:02.660
It was you who led me out of the Wilderness,

39:05.430 --> 39:08.910
allowing me to see the vast world.
